you say 'Jesus Christ'",

01:35:12.704 --> 01:35:13.839
like that is like ,

01:35:13.839 --> 01:35:15.837
like, certain evangelical Christians,

01:35:15.837 --> 01:35:17.837
it's like a poison, man.

01:35:19.094 --> 01:35:21.552
It is so offensive to them.

01:35:21.552 --> 01:35:24.507
And I'm like, so interesting to me

01:35:24.507 --> 01:35:27.982
that that is the thing
that is so offensive

01:35:27.982 --> 01:35:31.025
but there's all this other stuff

01:35:31.025 --> 01:35:34.800
that is actually offensive
that you don't care about.

01:35:34.800 --> 01:35:36.370
Hey, wait, yeah, I heard it.

01:35:36.370 --> 01:35:38.855
You listed 'em out, nipples.

01:35:38.855 --> 01:35:41.461
Well-
Having my nipples.

01:35:41.461 --> 01:35:43.624
You know, just it's always
been fascinating to me-

01:35:43.624 --> 01:35:44.791
