01:35:53.511 --> 01:35:56.178
That's, yeah, the nipple part.

01:35:57.656 --> 01:35:59.073
So, I don't know.

01:36:01.436 --> 01:36:02.269
'Cause it's like you're right,

01:36:02.269 --> 01:36:04.979
I take that lots of
Christians who would be like,

01:36:04.979 --> 01:36:07.427
"I agree with this, but were
you gonna play it for somebody?

01:36:07.427 --> 01:36:11.496
