number of times," you know.

01:36:11.496 --> 01:36:13.074
And, again, not all
Christians are like this.

01:36:13.074 --> 01:36:14.948
A lot of Christians have woken
up to the fact that like,

01:36:14.948 --> 01:36:17.407
"Hey, guys, like, cursing,"

01:36:17.407 --> 01:36:19.037
and even saying like, "Do you really think

01:36:19.037 --> 01:36:20.619
