01:55:13.187 --> 01:55:14.255
Hi, Rhett and Link.

01:55:14.255 --> 01:55:17.869
This is Natalie calling from Ontario.

01:55:17.869 --> 01:55:20.177
I went on my YouTube Music today

01:55:20.177 --> 01:55:22.933
and it told me that I have
listened to James and the Shame

01:55:22.933 --> 01:55:25.933
987 minutes, which is about 16 hours

01:55:28.116 --> 01:55:30.714
over the course of two songs.

01:55:30.714 --> 01:55:32.537
Just wanted to let you
know that I love the music

01:55:32.537 --> 01:55:33.955
and I can't wait for
the rest of the album.

01:55:33.955 --> 01:55:35.939
Thank you so much for
putting it out there.

01:55:35.939 --> 01:55:37.481
Hey, guys.

01:55:37.481 --> 01:55:38.824
First of all, love the show.

01:55:38.824 --> 01:55:43.446
Long-time fan, super stoked
to hear your full album.

01:55:43.446 --> 01:55:45.068
Congrats on it, dude.

01:55:45.068 --> 01:55:46.935
First three songs were great.

01:55:46.935 --> 01:55:48.680
Love you guys, thanks, bye.

01:55:48.680 --> 01:55:50.462
Rhett, in my evening
listening to your song

01:55:50.462 --> 01:55:53.055
"Where We're Going" and
bawling my eyes out.

01:55:53.055 --> 01:55:55.283
I'm 36 years old, my wife is 35.

01:55:55.283 --> 01:55:57.437
I have two boys, 10 and 8.

01:55:57.437 --> 01:56:00.842
This past Memorial Day
Weekend she had a stroke

01:56:00.842 --> 01:56:03.075
and she's been working
incredibly hard in rehab

01:56:03.075 --> 01:56:05.791
to regain the use of her left side

01:56:05.791 --> 01:56:07.493
and various mental blocks still.

01:56:07.493 --> 01:56:09.201
Needless to say, this has been a whirlwind

01:56:09.201 --> 01:56:10.787
and scary last few months.

01:56:10.787 --> 01:56:12.693
My days are quite long now,

01:56:12.693 --> 01:56:14.398
keeping everything
afloat and moving forward

01:56:14.398 --> 01:56:16.185
for my boys and for her,

01:56:16.185 --> 01:56:17.808
and this song just perfectly embodies

01:56:17.808 --> 01:56:19.067
how much I love my wife

01:56:19.067 --> 01:56:22.030
and how much I am still
just so happy to be with her

01:56:22.030 --> 01:56:23.571
and look forward to
sharing our lives together

01:56:23.571 --> 01:56:25.318
no matter what happens along the way.

01:56:25.318 --> 01:56:27.510
I was just so moved and
compelled by this song

01:56:27.510 --> 01:56:29.493
that I had to share this with you, Rhett,

01:56:29.493 --> 01:56:31.842
and you know how much your
music is impacting people.

01:56:31.842 --> 01:56:34.275
Thank you both for
everything you give to us

01:56:34.275 --> 01:56:36.747
and everything you share with us.

